<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My First Website</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #eef2ff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 15px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      max-width: 450px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-radius: 15px;
    }
    h1 { color: #2347a5; }
    p { color: #444; line-height: 1.6; }
    a {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #2347a5;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Welcome to My Website!</h1>
    <p>I am learning to build websites using cloud technology.</p>
    <p>My website is available online for everyone.</p>
    <a href="https://wa.me/">Contact Me</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html
